      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在我去实习之前，\n虽然她也是频繁地在恶作剧，但内容相对是没这么激烈的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d5e25aef815132e59ea9ec29de184b04a1c427b04a31e98a4ba4bf8d5c6717c6",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
