      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "于是我一刻也等不及地开始四处寻找新光风。\n她……就呆站在校舍后方的一个角落。",
      "source_fingerprint": "60be2fe47b8e8d5c5b56e9522498d1a134aa13df1fb30f26a6c5a37263d15f04",
