      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“多看风风几眼”。\n看着她颤抖的背影，我仿佛听到了这样的声音。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cbb13da1ab1b57aa488adcf860388a9073dbf6dcbfecd537c542cd2ff0a11b58",
