      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "每次她跑输比赛的那天就一定会来对我恶作剧。\n她看到我受惊吓的表情就会笑得非常开心。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5f54a6497e5ee8dedfc2a8a40f7aa73aa0ef0a10414d52876dedca78ec57e5b3",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
