      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "新光风就是利用恶作剧\n来宣泄她跑输比赛的挫折感吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "59f6b12e931ada1e471849b445e43906917e2441a4c343ca5e5f00208aefe9d5",
